            "closed_state_header_text": "#121212",
            "closed_state_row_icon": "#121212",
            "closed_state_collapse_icon": "#1a237e",
            "closed_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "closed_state_collapse_bg": "#121212",
            "closed_state_content_bg": "#f9f9f9",
            "closed_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "open_colors_on_hover": true,
            "open_state_border": "#d5aeea",
            "open_state_header_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_header_text": "#000000",
            "open_state_row_icon": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_collapse_icon": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "open_state_collapse_bg": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p>It relies on a reliable 3W hand-crank generator that converts your physical movement into immediate electrical power. Unlike solar chargers that fail at night or standard power banks that lose charge over time, this mechanical system guarantees energy on demand. Combined with a rugged aluminum casing, it’s engineered to withstand harsh environments and perform when the grid goes down.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "desc_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How To Use",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "collapse_icon_style": "standard",
            "collapse_icon_radius": 15,
