            "corner_radius": 8,
            "enable_custom_style": false,
            "heading_padding_vertical": 12,
            "heading_padding_horizontal": 10,
            "content_padding_vertical": 10,
            "content_padding_horizontal": 10,
            "closed_state_border": "#dddddd",
            "closed_state_header_bg": "#f9f9f9",
            "closed_state_header_text": "#121212",
            "closed_state_row_icon": "#121212",
            "closed_state_collapse_icon": "#1a237e",
            "closed_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "closed_state_collapse_bg": "#121212",
            "closed_state_content_bg": "#f9f9f9",
            "closed_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "open_colors_on_hover": true,
            "open_state_border": "#d5aeea",
            "open_state_header_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_header_text": "#000000",
            "open_state_row_icon": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_collapse_icon": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "open_state_collapse_bg": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p>The intuitive design makes it foolproof during an emergency:</p><ul><li><strong>Generate Power:</strong> Simply rotate the hand crank at a steady pace to charge the internal 1000mAh battery.</li><li><strong>Boost Your Phone:</strong> Plug your USB charging cable directly into the output port for an emergency battery boost to make critical calls.</li><li><strong>Start a Fire:</strong> Press the ignition button to activate the windproof heating wire, then touch dry tinder to it for an instant flame.</li><li><strong>Stay Informed & Safe:</strong> Use the side switches to instantly activate the LED flashlight or tune into SW/FM radio frequencies for weather updates.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "desc_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Why People Keep Using It",
            "heading_size": "medium",
