            "open_state_collapse_bg": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p>It provides ultimate peace of mind. Instead of cluttering a go-bag or glovebox with a separate flashlight, radio, lighter, and bulky power bank, this compact 5-in-1 tool saves crucial space without sacrificing utility. Customers love that it’s a \"set and forget\" survival essential—always ready for power outages, off-grid camping trips, or severe weather emergencies.</p>",
