          }
        },
        "column_weKzrp": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "post_author": "Chloe M.",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "10h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>The biggest shift was how sturdy and compact this tool feels. I tossed it right into my truck's glovebox. The aluminum case is heavy-duty, the electronic fire starter works flawlessly in the wind, and it actually delivers real emergency power to my phone when needed. Worth every penny.</p>",
            "post_image": "shopify://shop_images/3CB4CC80-91AE-4F4F-9DFE-354A3EFE9BE0.png",
            "post_reactions": "like, love, care",
            "post_reactions_text": "845",
            "post_comments_text": "54 Comments",
            "comment_1_author": "Comment author",
            "comment_1_author_verified": false,
            "comment_1_time": "2h ago",
            "comment_1_text": "",
            "comment_2_author": "Comment author",
            "comment_2_author_verified": false,
            "comment_2_time": "3h ago",
            "comment_2_text": ""
          }
        },
        "column_WCRMNm": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "post_author": "Anna K.",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "1 day ago",
            "post_text": "<p>I was skeptical at first, but the quality of this emergency device is impressive. The aluminum case feels premium, heavy-duty, and testing the features was a breeze. Already feeling much more 'in control' and prepared for hurricane season after just putting it in my go-bag. Highly recommend for anyone on the fence!</p>",
            "post_image": "shopify://shop_images/FC32DB06-271F-415A-AEFF-E01CE7B10097.jpg",
            "post_reactions": "like, love, care",
            "post_reactions_text": "1.1k",
            "post_comments_text": "26 Comments",
            "comment_1_author": "Comment author",
            "comment_1_author_verified": false,
            "comment_1_time": "2h ago",
            "comment_1_text": "",
            "comment_2_author": "Comment author",
            "comment_2_author_verified": false,
            "comment_2_time": "3h ago",
            "comment_2_text": ""
          }
