        "review_1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "post_author": "Jackson R.",
            "post_author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/b27a418cf6849a21dfba046d8db11c34.jpg",
            "post_author_verified": true,
            "post_time": "2 weeks ago",
            "post_text": "<p>Fast shipping and securely packaged as promised. The unboxing experience was great, and the hand-crank mechanism is surprisingly smooth and quiet. I can crank it to listen to the morning weather radio without waking up the whole camp. Finally, an off-grid survival solution that makes sense. </p>",
            "post_image": "shopify://shop_images/D0314726-C8A0-4406-A273-DA55959C40FD.jpg",
            "post_reactions": "like, love, care",
            "post_reactions_text": "148",
            "post_comments_text": "23 Comments",
            "comment_1_author": "Comment author",
            "comment_1_author_verified": false,
