          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "post_author": "Sarah J.",
            "post_author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_jktpo0jktpo0jktp.png",
            "post_author_verified": true,
            "post_time": "1 month ago",
            "post_text": "<p>This is so much better than carrying around dead batteries and wet matches. The windproof ignition actually sparks up instantly, just like they claim. It’s simple, effective, and the switches and radio dial are very easy to navigate, even for someone my age. </p>",
            "post_image": "shopify://shop_images/7D2F2370-49EB-4543-8E1A-07A88A3441C0.jpg",
